<EchoMarketingShell title="For Developers" eyebrow="Coding agent workflow" description="EchoAI helps developers inspect codebases, edit files, run checks, manage sessions, use MCP tools, and hand off local tasks to desktop.">
  <section class="echo-grid">
    <article class="echo-card span-3"><h2>Code</h2><p>Read, grep, patch, diff, diagnose, and run project commands through the runtime.</p></article>
    <article class="echo-card span-3"><h2>Review</h2><p>Quality and security review flows reuse EchoAI review heuristics and tool traces.</p></article>
    <article class="echo-card span-3"><h2>Context</h2><p>Projects, notes, memories, uploaded files, and session history become structured context.</p></article>
    <article class="echo-card span-3"><h2>Local action</h2><p>Desktop gateway performs sensitive filesystem and terminal work with approvals.</p></article>
  </section>
</EchoMarketingShell>

